ADDITIONAL NOTICE — AUTOMATED TRADING

This repository contains design material for an automated trading system.
The MIT terms above grant broad permission to use and modify it; they do not
and cannot grant permission to trade.

Deploying automated order entry against a live market venue requires, at
minimum: broker-dealer registration or sponsored market access, exchange
conformance certification, pre-trade risk controls satisfying SEC Rule 15c3-5,
and compliance with Regulation NMS, Regulation SHO, the LULD Plan, and CAT
reporting obligations. None of that is conferred by this licence.

Nothing here has been compiled, simulated, or run on hardware, and nothing has
been reviewed by a compliance professional. Automated trading systems can lose
money faster than a human can react. See the disclaimer in README.md.

Exchange specifications, regulatory rules, and fee schedules referenced in this
repository change over time. Figures are marked "Verify:" with their
authoritative source. Confirm against the primary document before relying on
any of them.
